	"Description": "I've been a bit spooked by the updates happening recently and thusly decided to make an AiO download for the Fashion Sense versions hair conversions I've done so far. There are still individual downloads (I don't think the game could handle an AiO for CP, there's over 150 hairs in the pack), I just want to have them on the same page to avoid any issues with moderation.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />I've also take the time to sit down and actually fix my mods. I'm truly sorry they've been broken for so long.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />Getting into the AiO version, the hair's will be named in game like they were before I combined them because I am lazy and changing the names would take too long ;-;\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />As for the content patcher version, I should have hopefully fixed any issues anyone was having with them. Do keep in mind, however, that I am currently on version 1.5.6 (I refuse to let my scenery mods go) and I may have messed up somewhere. Sorry in advance.",
